  "body": "Also make sure to reconsume instead of switching to the bogus\r\nDOCTYPE state so that a U+0000 that causes the parser to enter the\r\nbogus DOCTYPE state is itself caught as a parse error.\r\n\r\nFixes #2684.\r\n\r\nTests: https://github.com/html5lib/html5lib-tests/pull/103\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n@whatwg/html-parser ",
